about: an insert into an inline array counts members, not commas, so it never lands inside a string
op: insertJsonValue
path: ["includes"]
literal: "dist/**"
at: 2
=== input
{
  "includes": ["**/*.{ts,tsx}", "[a,b]", "!**/{x,y}/**"]
}
=== output
{
  "includes": ["**/*.{ts,tsx}", "[a,b]", "dist/**", "!**/{x,y}/**"]
}
